  "prompt": "For each channel, which campaign started first? A campaign starts on its start_date. When campaigns of a channel tie on start_date, keep the one with the lower campaign_id. Return three columns, in this order: channel_id, campaign_id and start_date. Return one row for each channel with campaigns. Any row order is fine.",
